IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rcrd-rebates`

-- Rates and Charges (Rebates and Deferments) Act 1992 (WA), with the Regulations 1992 -- worked cases, from the seat of
-- the pensioner or senior ratepayer.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or a council or Water Corporation notice. The limits are those of the deposited Regulations
-- (rr 3(2), 4(1A), 4(2)); the charges (rates of $1,800, a levy of $90, a water supply charge of $250) are ILLUSTRATIVE.
-- The rating year 2073/74 has 365 days.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table (scratchpad gen_wa_rates-and-charges-rebates-and-deferments-act-1992_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from the text.

